control: The UI is served over TLS with both of its TLS files and over plain HTTP with neither, and refuses to start with one
removes: a TLS file path of spaces counts as set, so a certificate beside a blank key path is admitted
packages: ./ui/internal/core/serving
tests: TestTLSIsBothFilesOrNeither
scheduled-count: no

